<title>UK: BFG Hypo sets 200 million mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>BFG Hypo sets 200 million mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK, FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    30.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE  S-15.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.40	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> N0TES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 209</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
